<!-- Example of Digital NOTAM for a apron usage limitation change ("Prohibited for").
     Apron A is not allowed for unscheduled aircraft with mass >= 40 tons and tilt wing aircraft:
  
     Airport/Heliport: EADB DONLON/INTL.
                Apron: EADB DONLON/INTL. | APRON A
           Start Time: 2028-03-08 08:00
             End Time: 2028-03-08 18:00
             Schedule: -
      Limitation Type: Prohibited for
           Limitation: Prior Permission: -
                       Prior Permission Details: -
                       Sublimitation 1: Aircraft - type: LANDPLANE
                                                 - weight: 40 T
                                                 - weight interpretation: AT_OR_ABOVE
                                        Flight   - purpose: NON_SCHEDULED
                       Sublimitation 2: Aircraft - type: TILT_WING
               Reason: -
                 Note: -
-->

